      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 20000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.055\n    loan_term_years = 5\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n    \n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -number_of_payments)\n    )\n    \n    first_month_interest = principal * monthly_interest_rate\n    principal_payment = monthly_payment - first_month_interest\n    \n    # return answer\n    return round(principal_payment, 2)\n```",
